WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：你是谁？我为什么要告诉你？
You: Who are you? Why should I tell you?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:27.557
Magnus Thorne。轮到你了。
Magnus Thorne. Now you.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:30.069
你就是我一直在追的气味。
You're the scent I've been chasing.

00:00:32.781 --> 00:00:35.093
关掉车库监控。谁也别下来。
Kill the garage cameras. Nobody comes down.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：你想干什么？还有你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: What do you want? And what's with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:42.633
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:47.873 --> 00:00:50.185
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:52.697
跟我走。我会解释。
Come with me. I'll explain.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：转身朝电梯走去
You: Turn and walk toward the elevator
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:02.765
去吧，如果你非走不可。
Go if you must.

00:01:07.989 --> 00:01:10.301
楼上对你不安全。
Upstairs is not safe for you.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
你：你这人怎么莫名其妙的，我凭什么跟你走？
You: You're not making any sense. Why should I go with you?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:17.841
你可以不去。
You don't have to.

00:01:20.569 --> 00:01:22.881
现在我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:23.081 --> 00:01:25.393
午夜前，这里每一头狼都会知道。
Every wolf here will know.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：把手覆在他拳头上
You: Rest your hand on his fist
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:35.445
别。
Don't.

00:01:40.685 --> 00:01:42.997
你好暖。
You're warm.

00:01:43.197 --> 00:01:45.509
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：什么狼？你是狼人吗？证明给我看。
You: What wolf? Are you a werewolf? Prove it.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:53.049
是。看着我。
Yes. Look at me.

00:01:55.777 --> 00:01:57.252
别移开眼睛。
Don't look away.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:05.625
你本不该撞上我。
You were never meant to find me.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：伸手碰他的手背
You: Touch the back of his hand
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:10.653
还是暖的。
Still warm.

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:20.717
没人敢碰我。
No one dares touch me.

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:23.229
到了。进来吧。
We're here. Come inside.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：那你找上我到底是为了什么？
You: Then why did you come for me?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:30.785
因为你是我的。
Because you're mine.

00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:33.297
进来吧，我再告诉你。
Come inside. Then I'll tell you.

00:02:36.009 --> 00:02:38.321
是我的气味。会好的。
It's my scent. It'll settle.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
你：走向楼梯，自己看看
You: Head for the stairs to see for yourself
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:45.861
去吧，看看。
Go. Look.

00:02:51.101 --> 00:02:53.413
我今晚本来在楼上。
I was upstairs tonight.

00:02:53.613 --> 00:02:55.925
我从那里走了出来。
I walked out on it.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：我可以跟你进去，但你得把来龙去脉讲清楚。
You: I'll go in with you, but you have to tell me the whole story.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:05.993
好。我全告诉你。
Fair. I'll tell you everything.

00:03:06.193 --> 00:03:08.505
这边。
This way.

00:03:08.705 --> 00:03:11.017
今晚我本该和另一个女人订婚。
I was promised to another woman tonight.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：走到他身边，等他开门
You: Walk to his side and wait for him to open the door
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:21.069
靠近点。
Stay close.

00:03:25.807 --> 00:03:27.616
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:03:27.816 --> 00:03:29.626
她轮不到你过问。
She is not your concern.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：你刚刚还说要订婚，现在又来找我，什么意思？
You: You were just about to get engaged, and now you come for me. What does that mean?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:41.201
在我找到你的那一刻，那就什么都不是了。
It meant nothing the moment I found you.

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:43.713
Selene从来都不是我的。
Selene was never mine.

00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:51.249
那就告诉我，你在怕什么。
Then tell me what you're afraid of.

00:03:51.549 --> 00:03:53.849
你：拉他到沙发坐下
You: Pull him over to sit on the sofa
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:58.805
“你带路，我跟着。”
Lead. I'll follow.

00:04:01.517 --> 00:04:03.829
“找了三十年。”
Thirty years of searching.

00:04:04.029 --> 00:04:06.341
“再来一次，我还是会这么做，每一次。”
I'd do it again. Every time.

00:04:09.153 --> 00:04:11.453
你：我不想躲，我倒要看看她到底是谁。
You: I'm not hiding. I want to see who she really is.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:04:11.553 --> 00:04:16.409
很好。那你就当面面对他们。
Good. Then you face them.

00:04:19.121 --> 00:04:21.433
Alpha，Harland要她今晚交人。
(Luca) Alpha. Harland demands her. Tonight.

00:04:21.633 --> 00:04:23.945
那就让他们听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer.

00:04:26.757 --> 00:04:29.057
你：挽住他的手臂一起走
You: Take his arm and walk together
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 15 轮 · Realtime round 15）

00:04:29.157 --> 00:04:31.485
“那就一起。”
Together, then.

00:04:36.725 --> 00:04:39.037
“他们碰不到你。”
They will not touch you.

00:04:41.749 --> 00:04:44.061
“我还有个秘密，在里面。”
I have a secret. Inside.

00:04:44.361 --> 00:04:46.661
你：那你会选她还是选我？
You: So will you choose her or me?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 16 轮 · Realtime round 16）

00:04:46.761 --> 00:04:49.089
我选你。
I choose you.

00:04:51.817 --> 00:04:53.627
待在我身边。
Stay beside me.

00:04:57.846 --> 00:04:59.655
她是我的Mate。
She is my Mate.

00:05:01.965 --> 00:05:04.265
你：走上前，站到他身边
You: Step up and stand beside him
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 17 轮 · Realtime round 17）

00:05:04.365 --> 00:05:06.693
就在这儿。
Right here.

00:05:09.421 --> 00:05:11.733

Stand with me.

00:05:14.445 --> 00:05:16.757

There is another door.

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.869
你：好，我留下来。
You: Okay, I'll stay.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 18 轮 · Realtime round 18）

00:05:21.969 --> 00:05:24.297
那就留下。
Then stay.

00:05:27.025 --> 00:05:30.174
我不会让他们带走你。
I won't let them take you.

00:05:33.724 --> 00:05:36.873
待在原地，别动。
Stay where you are.
